rewritten-to-match
Same loop, same floating-point expressions, same growing byte buffer across warmup and timed runs, hashed after the last run (untimed in both). The language has no bit operators: acc << 1 is acc * 2, acc |= 1 is acc + 1 (the low bit is zero), acc <<= k is acc * 2^k, and the header digits are written arithmetically. Scratch state rebuilt every run (the reference's locals: buf) is declared `unlogged`, kept out of the undo log.
